  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://chirpneighbors.local/contracts/asset-packaging-input-v2.schema.json",
  "description": "Versioned private image-pipeline structural boundary: legacy render v2, pose render v3, packaging input v2 and retained RGBA source v1. Actual byte hashes, palette/grid/alpha rules, graph/reference/catalog consistency, supported strategy and review/ownership require runtime admission. Source artifacts can contain private pixel bytes and are not public projections. Structural validation grants no provider execution, species fidelity or review authorization."
}
